    <panel_attributes>insight-service
--
Insight
port 8084

Kafka Streams topology:
velocity, batch state, risk
Markdown Decision Agent (FR14)
Briefing Agent (FR15)

consumes: batch-received,
stock-level-changed, item-sold,
markdown-applied,
sell-through-risk-detected
produces: sell-through-risk-
detected, markdown-recommended
bg=#FFF2CC</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
